      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Introduces the Bi-Regional Workshop on National Health Accounts held in New Delhi (28 November–1 December 2006) for 26 participants from eight South-East Asia and three Western Pacific countries to strengthen national health financial management through technical training and cross-country learning.",
