        {
          "text": "Summarizes the inaugural session opened by Dr Than Sein on behalf of WHO SEARO Regional Director Dr Samlee Plianbangchang, emphasizing the need to institutionalize National Health Accounts within ministries of health as an evidence-based policy and resource-tracking tool.",
